<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Norwich yr share jumps 35 pct, declares div.</title>
<headline>Norwich yr share jumps 35 pct, declares div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr ended December 31</p>
<p>		(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (cts)		 29.3     vs   21.7</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 19.5     vs    --</p>
<p>    Shareholders' income  87.74    vs   67.89</p>
<p>    Taxation		   3.72    vs    5.69</p>
<p>    Retained income	 42.78    vs   62.20</p>
<p>Div payable: April 25</p>
<p>On register: April 4</p>
<p>Full name: Norwich Holdings S.A. Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said prospects continued to be positive. Barring any unforeseen circumstances it expected another solid performance in the current year.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
